@startuml membershipsubmodule_list
title GET /membership-sub-modules — List all MembershipSubModules

actor Client
participant "MembershipSubModuleController" as Controller
participant "ListMembershipSubModulesUseCase\n<<port.in>>" as UseCase
participant "ListMembershipSubModulesService" as Service
participant "MembershipSubModuleRepository\n<<port.out>>" as Repo
participant "MembershipSubModuleJpaMapper" as Mapper
participant "MembershipSubModuleJpaRepository\n<<spring-data>>" as JpaRepo
database "MySQL" as DB

note over Client, DB
  AuthFilter ya validó el JWT y puso EmployeeContext
  en SecurityContextHolder antes de llegar al controller.
end note

note over Client, DB
  Hibernate `@SoftDelete` filtra automáticamente:
  - DELETE → UPDATE enabled=false
  - Todo SELECT añade WHERE enabled=true
end note

Client -> Controller : GET /membership-sub-modules
activate Controller

Controller -> UseCase : listAll()
note right of UseCase
  @PreAuthorize:
  admin.all OR hasRole('SYSTEM')
end note
UseCase -> Service : listAll()
activate Service

Service -> Repo : findAll()
activate Repo
Repo -> JpaRepo : findAll()
JpaRepo -> DB : SELECT membership_sub_module\nJOIN FETCH (membership, subModule)\nvia @EntityGraph
DB --> JpaRepo : rows[]
JpaRepo --> Repo : List<MembershipSubModuleJpaEntity>
Repo -> Mapper : toDomain(entity) por cada row
Mapper --> Repo : List<MembershipSubModule>
Repo --> Service : List<MembershipSubModule>
deactivate Repo

Service -> Service : stream().map(MembershipSubModuleDto::from).toList()
Service --> UseCase : List<MembershipSubModuleDto>
UseCase --> Controller : List<MembershipSubModuleDto>
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : stream().map(toResponse).toList()
Controller --> Client : 200 OK\nList<MembershipSubModuleResponse>
deactivate Controller

@enduml
